WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:02.099
- [Conan] Now I want
to apologize for this.

00:00:02.099 --> 00:00:04.332
We've been very busy doing these shows.

00:00:04.332 --> 00:00:05.823
I did not get to eat lunch today.

00:00:05.823 --> 00:00:07.369
I didn't have a chance.

00:00:07.369 --> 00:00:08.745
So can I just take a second, could someone

00:00:08.745 --> 00:00:10.027
bring me out a sandwich, please?

00:00:10.027 --> 00:00:12.063
I just want a, I would
love to eat, thank you.

00:00:12.063 --> 00:00:13.336
And thank you for bringing them

00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:14.992
through those space age doors, yeah.

00:00:14.992 --> 00:00:15.825
Thank you.

00:00:17.021 --> 00:00:18.049
- [Voiceover] There he is.

00:00:18.049 --> 00:00:19.048
- [Conan] It's great.

00:00:19.048 --> 00:00:20.319
You just applauded a sandwich.

00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:23.319
(audience cheering)

00:00:25.097 --> 00:00:28.514
That's how good the Comic-Con crowds are.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:33.601
He asked for a sandwich and there it was!

00:00:33.601 --> 00:00:35.767
Wait a minute, this sandwich is huge.

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:37.060
There's no way I can eat this whole thing.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.296
I need to cut it in half.

00:00:38.296 --> 00:00:39.373
Andy, do you have a knife?

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:40.573
- [Andy] They don't let me have knives.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.705
- [Conan] Okay.

00:00:41.705 --> 00:00:42.876
(audience laughing)

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:43.710
That's right, me neither.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.342
I guess I'll just have
to throw it in the trash,

00:00:45.342 --> 00:00:47.002
I mean, there's nothing else I can do.

00:00:47.002 --> 00:00:50.186
- [Andy] No, just ask
Bruce to cut it for you.

00:00:50.186 --> 00:00:51.684
- [Conan] You're right.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.318
Hey, Bruce, can you please come out here?

00:00:53.318 --> 00:00:56.274
(audience cheering)

00:00:56.274 --> 00:00:58.857
(upbeat music)

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:07.273
(clapping)

00:01:09.788 --> 00:01:12.038
(cheering)

00:01:19.171 --> 00:01:20.228
- [Bruce] What's up, Ginger?

00:01:20.228 --> 00:01:23.489
- [Conan] Well, I need
to cut this sandwich.

00:01:23.489 --> 00:01:24.949
I was wondering if you
could maybe give me a hand.

00:01:24.949 --> 00:01:26.199
- [Bruce] Sure.

00:01:27.669 --> 00:01:29.151
How about that hand?

00:01:29.151 --> 00:01:30.401
- [Conan] Yeah.

00:01:31.952 --> 00:01:34.672
- [Bruce] Yeah, you better
step back little girl.

00:01:34.672 --> 00:01:36.114
- [Conan] Okay.

00:01:36.114 --> 00:01:37.432
(laughs)

00:01:37.432 --> 00:01:39.764
- [Bruce] All right you
crusty son of a bitch.

00:01:39.764 --> 00:01:42.109
(revving)

00:01:42.109 --> 00:01:43.386
Come get some!

00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:44.803
Oh yeah, oh yeah!

00:01:49.957 --> 00:01:52.540
(Conan laughs)

00:01:53.487 --> 00:01:54.984
(revving)

00:01:54.984 --> 00:01:56.710
- [Conan] Wow, incredible.

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.710
(audience cheering)

00:02:03.396 --> 00:02:06.177
Thank you, Bruce, that's,

00:02:06.177 --> 00:02:07.900
that's fantastic, thank you.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:09.395
- [Bruce] You're welcome, you're welcome.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.378
If there's anything else you need,

00:02:11.378 --> 00:02:12.632
I'll be in my dressing room,

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:15.627
just polishing the old blade
if you know what I mean.

00:02:15.627 --> 00:02:18.283
(audience laughing)

00:02:18.283 --> 00:02:21.283
(audience cheering)

00:02:24.999 --> 00:02:26.382
Of course I mean masturbating.

00:02:26.382 --> 00:02:27.748
- [Conan] Yes, I know.

00:02:27.748 --> 00:02:29.146
(audience laughing)

00:02:29.146 --> 00:02:31.643
Bruce Campbell everybody.

00:02:31.643 --> 00:02:33.391
(audience cheering)

00:02:33.391 --> 00:02:35.974
(upbeat music)

00:02:38.112 --> 00:02:40.503
The second season of Ash Versus Evil Dead

00:02:40.503 --> 00:02:43.024
premiers on Stars this October.

00:02:43.024 --> 00:02:44.068
A lot more show coming
up, we'll be right back.

